  "description": "Nemesis Shield MCP server: add positive-security (allow-list) protection to every web app, standalone or edge API (Supabase/Vercel/Cloudflare), LLM feature and business-logic flow you build, straight from your editor. Learns normal behavior and blocks the rest (zero-days, IDOR/BOLA, broken auth), where a signature WAF is blind.",
